# SIP Management Verification Plan
- [ ] Open http://localhost:3000/investments and login if needed
- [ ] Locate the Holdings Ledger table and find "SBI" (SIP)
- [ ] Click "Manage SIP Skips & Status" button
- [ ] Verify initial stats on the modal (Start Date, Deposits Paid, Skipped Payments, Invested Capital)
- [ ] Toggle first installment to "Skipped" and verify state
- [ ] Toggle second installment to "Skipped" and verify "Skipped Payments" count increases
- [ ] Click "Stop Plan" and confirm the cancellation
- [ ] Verify modal status updates to "Plan Suspended / Cancelled"
- [ ] Click "Done" and close modal
- [ ] Verify that Net Return/ROI in the stats grid and Holdings Ledger has been re-evaluated
